01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Olympus Has Fallen is a 2013 American political action thriller film directed and co-produced by Antoine Fuqua from a screenplay
written by Creighton Rothenberger and Katrin Benedikt, and is the first installment in the Has Fallen film series.

12
01:05:27,272 --> 01:05:33,272
The film stars Gerard Butler (who also co-produced), Aaron Eckhart, and Morgan Freeman with Angela Bassett, Robert Forster,
Cole Hauser, Ashley Judd, Melissa Leo, Dylan McDermott, Radha Mitchell, and Rick Yune in supporting roles.

13
01:10:54,545 --> 01:11:00,545
The plot depicts a North Korean-led guerrilla assault on the White House, and focuses
on disgraced Secret Service agent Mike Banning's efforts to rescue U.S.

14
