President Benjamin Asher.

15
01:21:49,090 --> 01:21:55,090
The film was released in the United States on March 22, 2013, by FilmDistrict,
and grossed $170 million against a $70 million production budget.

16
01:27:16,363 --> 01:27:22,363
The film received mixed reviews from critics, who praised Fuqua's direction and
Butler's performance, but criticized the overt violence and the screenplay.

17
01:32:43,636 --> 01:32:49,636
Olympus Has Fallen was one of two 2013 films that depicted a terrorist attack against the White
House; the other was White House Down, which was released three months later.

18
01:38:10,909 --> 01:38:16,909
A sequel, titled London Has Fallen, was released on March 4, 2016,
with the principal cast members reprising their roles.

19
